    {
      "source": "Converts an aggregate represented by its root into a <a href=\"RootAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>RootAggregateChange</code></a> for an upsert operation. Always\nemits a <a href=\"DbAction.UpsertRoot.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction.UpsertRoot</code></a> as the root action regardless of whether the entity is new or existing, followed\nby delete and insert actions for any referenced entities.",
      "translation": "将以其根表示的聚合转换为用于上插操作的<a href=\"RootAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>RootAggregateChange</code></a>。始终发出一个<a href=\"DbAction.UpsertRoot.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction.UpsertRoot</code></a>作为根操作，无论实体是新创建的还是已存在的，随后再为任何引用的实体发出删除和插入操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
